<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pre-interview Questionnaire Slide</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #111; /* Dark surrounding background */
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .slide-container {
            width: 1024px;
            height: 768px;
            background-color: #1b1c20; /* Slide background color matching the dark slate */
            /* Subtle radial gradient to mimic presentation screen lighting */
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #232428 0%, #151619 100%);
            position: relative;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            padding: 45px 50px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        /* Left Column for Main Text Content */
        .left-content {
            width: 740px;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .section h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin: 0 0 12px 0;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .section h2 .subtitle {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #999999;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }

        .section ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0 0 0 25px;
        }

        .section li {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 25px;
            color: #dcdcdc;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        /* Custom triangular bullet point */
        .section li::before {
            content: "\25B8"; 
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 2px;
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .citation {
            margin-top: auto;
            align-self: flex-end;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            margin-right: 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #bbbbbb;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* Right Column Elements (Vertical Text) */
        .vertical-text-container {
            position: absolute;
            left: 850px; /* Positioned relative to left edge so transform origin acts predictably */
            top: 110px;
            transform: rotate(90deg);
            transform-origin: top left;
            font-size: 95px;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 0.85;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: -3px;
        }

        .vertical-text-container .word-data {
            display: block;
            padding-left: 230px; /* Pushes 'data' further down the rotated axis */
        }

        .vertical-text-container .word-collection {
            display: block;
        }

        /* Bottom Right Book Placeholder */
        .bottom-right-group {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 45px;
            right: 50px;
            width: 145px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .asterisk-note {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        /* Faithful Placeholder for the book cover */
        .book-placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 215px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #777;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
        }

        .book-top-bar {
            padding: 5px 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
        }

        .r-logo {
            float: right;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #222;
        }

        .book-title {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #111;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
            clear: right;
        }

        .book-subtitle {
            font-size: 5.5px;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .book-image-panel {
            flex-grow: 1;
            background-color: #5c7f99; /* Matches the slate blue tint of the photo area */
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #3a5366;
        }

        .book-image-panel::after {
            content: "[Student Photo]";
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .book-author-bar {
            background-color: #0c274c; /* Dark blue footer */
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 6px;
            padding: 6px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="slide-container">
        <!-- Main Text Column -->
        <div class="left-content">
            <div class="section">
                <h2>Pre-interview Questionnaire</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Establish usage patterns of participant</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h2>Semistructured Interview <span class="subtitle">(First Session, 1 hour)</span></h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Probe how students understand self</li>
                    <li>Examine how sense is made of online/offline life</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h2>Synchronous Ethnographic Tour * <span class="subtitle">(Second Session, 1 hour)</span></h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Observe how students interact online</li>
                    <li>How is identity constructed/understood</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h2>Semistructured Interview <span class="subtitle">(First Session, 1 hour)</span></h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Probe how students understand self</li>
                    <li>Examine how sense is made of online/offline life</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="citation">
                (Martínez Alemán & Lynk Wartman, 2009, p. 23)
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Large Rotated Text -->
        <div class="vertical-text-container">
            <div class="word-data">data</div>
            <div class="word-collection">collection</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom Right Visual Elements -->
        <div class="bottom-right-group">
            <div class="asterisk-note">*</div>
            <div class="placeholder book-placeholder">
                <div class="book-top-bar">
                    <span class="r-logo">R</span>
                    <div class="book-title">Online Social Networking on Campus</div>
                    <div class="book-subtitle">Understanding What Matters in Student Culture</div>
                </div>
                <div class="book-image-panel"></div>
                <div class="book-author-bar">
                    Ana M. Martínez Alemán<br>
                    Katherine Lynk Wartman
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
